# Check that adding a tracked, unchanged file has no effect.
I setup2.inc
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "unchanged add"
No changes added to the commit.
<<<
+ f.txt notwug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "reverted add"
No changes added to the commit.
<<<
> rm f.txt
<<<
* f.txt
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "restored removal"
No changes added to the commit.
<<<
